@AdminService.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5127
@AdminService.Token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..3UhYcJKqwWkifz_8BFPfFLMNvWjwKrqF1VsS1mj-5ec

### Dashboard - Get admin monitoring dashboard
GET {{AdminService.API_HostAddress}}/api/Admin/dashboard
Authorization: {{AdminService.Token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Exception Shipments - Delayed, failed, stuck, etc.
GET {{AdminService.API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/shipments/exceptions
Authorization: {{AdminService.Token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Shipments
GET {{AdminService.API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/shipments
Authorization: {{AdminService.Token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Resolve Shipment - Mark as resolved
PUT {{AdminService.API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/resolve
Authorization: {{AdminService.Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Users - From AuthService
GET {{AdminService.API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: {{AdminService.Token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Update User Role - Promote user to ADMIN
PUT {{AdminService.API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: {{AdminService.Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### Get Reports - Analytics and statistics
GET {{AdminService.API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/reports
Authorization: {{AdminService.Token}}
Accept: application/json

###
